+/* WHOLE COVERS (owner, 2026-11-23: "The full covers aren't shown, and I agree. We should fix that." ... "as long as
+   everything's uniform"). Every cover on every music surface is the whole supplied artwork, scaled to fit inside the
+   same square box: nothing cropped, nothing drawn behind it (no plate, no tint, no glow), nothing laid over it, no
+   corner cut (AGENTS.md, hard rule 10). A cover that is not square shows the page above and below it, or beside it,
+   as in the approved comparison (V-1: object-fit contain, no radius, nothing behind). One rule, so the surfaces
+   cannot drift apart: the shelves, the album hero, the rows, the mini players, the Now Playing sheets, the artist
+   page, the catalogue and Creator Studio. The lock screen's artwork is the same files at their own sizes
+   (scripts/music-artwork.mjs). */
+.music-v2 .feat__bg,.music-v2 .alb__art,.music-v2 .deckbar__art,.music-v2 .music-mini__art,.music-v2 .music-now__art,
+.music-v2 .now__art--cover .now__film,.music-v2 .ap-album__art,.music-v2 .ap-card img,.music-v2 .ap-track img,
+.music-v2 .shelf .cov,.music-v2 .creator-track img{
